ED\",\"evidence\":\"Stream name is one of the mandatry field for every Nimbrel Probe agent.\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_a.md\",\"rationale\":\"Source A states that the stream name is a mandatory field for every agent.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"M-004\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"The Nimbrel Probe stream name is what seperates one instrumented process from the next.\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_b.md\",\"rationale\":\"Source B states this directly.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"M-005\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"The stream name cant contain arbitrary symbols\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_a.md\",\"rationale\":\"Source A states that the stream name cannot contain arbitrary symbols.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"M-006\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"Stream names are validated against ^[A-Za-z0-9 -]+$ before the agent registers.\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_a.md\",\"rationale\":\"Source A states this validation verbatim.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"M-007\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"Only letters, digits, spaces and hyphens are accepted\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_b.md\",\"rationale\":\"Source B states that only these characters are accepted, and source A agrees.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"M-008\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"letters, digits, spaces and hyphens only, and nothing else, or the agent refuses to start.\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_a.md\",\"rationale\":\"Source A states that the agent refuses to start if the name contains other characters.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"M-009\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"Stream name containing a . (dot) for exampe` checkout.web` along with a number of other symbols are refused by Nimbrel Probe\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_b.md\",\"rationale\":\"Source B states that dotted names such as checkout.web are refused.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"M-010\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"Stream name containing a . (dot) for exampe` checkout.web` along with a number of other symbols are refused by Nimbrel Probe\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_b.md\",\"rationale\":\"Source B states that a number of other symbols are refused too.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"M-011\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"Working as intended for now\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_b.md\",\"rationale\":\"Source B gives the cause as working as intended for now.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"M-012\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"one customer wanted the stream name left exactly as it stood because that string was the product name in use everywhere in the org\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_a.md\",\"rationale\":\"The claim generalises source A's single customer case, which is permitted at high fidelity.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"M-013\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"their reporting keyed of it\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_a.md\",\"rationale\":\"The claim generalises source A's statement that the customer's reporting keyed off the name.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"M-014\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"All Nimbrel Probe agents\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_a.md\",\"rationale\":\"Source A gives the environment as all Nimbrel Probe agents.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"M-015\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"No fix at present , rename the stream without the refused symbol\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_b.md\",\"rationale\":\"Source B states that there is no fix at present.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"M-016\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"A way round it that works\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_a.md\",\"rationale\":\"Source A presents a working workaround, and source B has a Workaround section.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"M-017\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"Rename the stream to drop the unsupported symbols so the Nimbrel Probe agent will register\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_a.md\",\"rationale\":\"Source A states this directly.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"M-018\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"Then carry the orignal name along as a global tag, so at least each trace keeps a link between the real name and the renamed one\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_a.md\",\"rationale\":\"Source A states this directly.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"M-019\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"https://docs.nimbrel.example/probe/agent/nodejs/current/configuration.html#global-tags\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_a.md\",\"rationale\":\"Source A links this nodejs configuration URL with a global-tags anchor for the global tag step.\"}]}","ttft_ms":4309,"type":"result","duration_ms":16527,"uuid":"ac86fc48-0e13-4d21-a4ff-81577e643744","ttft_stream_ms":1316,"time_to_request_ms":101,"first_content_frame_ms":1317,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
